    <string name="first_run_title">Welcome to EZ SOS</string>
    <string name="first_run_body">EZ SOS is mutual SOS coverage for people who all install this companion.\n\nIt needs SMS, phone, contacts, and location so it can:\n\n• Let you choose safety contacts who also use EZ SOS\n• Silently text them with GPS when you trigger SOS on the watch\n• Alarm this phone and your watch when a contact sends an SOS to you (not a quiet SMS ding)\n\nGrant SEND_SMS, RECEIVE_SMS, READ_SMS, READ_PHONE_STATE, READ_CONTACTS, and location when prompted. Phone state is required on many dual-SIM devices or SMS send fails.\n\nOn some devices you may also need to disable battery restrictions so inbound SMS is delivered in the background.\n\niOS cannot support this companion. Apple does not allow third-party apps to read SMS content or reliably send silent SMS.</string>
